# ${SRC_DIR}/tests/

Vitest tests for ${PROJECT_NAME}.

## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| [`setup.ts`](setup.ts) | Vitest global setup — jest-dom matchers wired here. |
| `unit/` | Component + hook + service tests. Mock fetch — no live network. |
| `e2e/` | Reserved for Playwright/Cypress scenarios (no runner wired in v1). |

## Conventions

- Test file: `<Name>.test.tsx` for components, `<name>.test.ts` for plain modules.
- One describe block per module under test.
- Use `vi.stubGlobal('fetch', ...)` to mock network in unit tests — no MSW dependency in v1.

